SDL-E1035 (spec/api.md)

  x unknown api sub-block head `raw`
   ,----
 1 | api '/x' { raw { then: { 1 }; }; };
   :            ^|^
   :             `-- not a sub-block head
   `----
  help: `raw { … };` is a top-level statement — api sub-block heads are the methods (or one `any` block), never `raw`
